### Rendered-file comparison: Ansible (Jinja2) vs Puppet (EPP) ###

Both nodes carry the same release and the same variable values, so the
only legitimate difference left is the managed-by banner each tool
stamps into the file it owns. Comments and blank lines are stripped
before diffing; nothing else is normalised.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
FILE: attendance.env
  IDENTICAL -- 8 significant lines match byte for byte
--------------------------------------------------------------------
FILE: attendance.service
  IDENTICAL -- 26 significant lines match byte for byte
--------------------------------------------------------------------
FILE: attendance.conf
  IDENTICAL -- 30 significant lines match byte for byte
--------------------------------------------------------------------
FILE: attendance
  IDENTICAL -- 10 significant lines match byte for byte
--------------------------------------------------------------------

RESULT: 4 of 4 managed files are byte-identical once each
tool's own banner comment is removed.
